          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "প্রতীক্ষা (prôtīkkhā) is a tatsama, Sanskrit pratīkṣā, \"expectation\" (Monier-Williams): the longer, hopeful kind of waiting."
            }
          ]
        },
